<html>
  <body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #111; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 24px;">
      <h1 style="color: #1370c6; margin: 0;">Omnicassion</h1>
    </div>

    <h2 style="margin-bottom: 16px;">Your Claim is Under Review</h2>

    <p>Hello,</p>

    <p>Thank you for claiming <strong>{{businessName}}</strong> on Omnicassion. Your claim has been submitted successfully and is now pending admin review.</p>

    <div style="background: #fef3c7; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; padding: 16px; margin: 24px 0;">
      <p style="margin: 0; color: #92400e;">
        <strong>What happens next?</strong><br>
        Our team will review your claim and supporting documents. This typically takes 1-2 business days.
      </p>
    </div>

    <p>You will receive an email notification once your claim has been reviewed.</p>

    <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e4e4e7; margin: 24px 0;" />

    <p style="color: #666; font-size: 14px;">
      While you wait, you can:
    </p>
    <ul style="color: #666; font-size: 14px; padding-left: 20px;">
      <li>Log in to your account to check the claim status</li>
      <li>Prepare your business information and portfolio</li>
      <li>Review our vendor guidelines</li>
    </ul>

    {{#if dashboardUrl}}
    <p style="text-align: center; margin: 24px 0;">
      <a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" style="background: #1370c6; color: #fff; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; display: inline-block;">Check Claim Status</a>
    </p>
    {{/if}}

    <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e4e4e7; margin: 24px 0;" />

    <p style="color: #666; font-size: 14px;">
      If you have any questions, please contact our support team.
    </p>

    <p style="color: #999; font-size: 12px; text-align: center;">
      &copy; {{currentYear}} Omnicassion. All rights reserved.
    </p>
  </body>
</html>
